userContent.text:
Build an interactive figure using SVG.js.

CONCEPT: A hash function h maps each actual key to a slot of table T, and when several keys collide they are simply strung together in that slot's doubly linked list — so the choice of h alone decides how evenly the keys spread and how long the chains get.
KEY INSIGHT (what students should walk away understanding): Chaining makes collisions harmless but not free — the hash function is the only thing standing between a table of short constant-time chains and one long linked list.
DEMO STEPS: 5 guided steps — implement the step player in #ui

FULL BLUEPRINT:
